OL,3,AUS and Iran trade strikes for first
OL,4,Atime in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Central Command said its had taken
OL,7,F"limited, precise action" against
OL,8,F"minelaying forces posing an imminent
OL,9,Fthreat in the Strait of Hormuz".
OL,11,FIran responded by attacking US bases in
OL,12,FJordan, state media said. Jordan's army
OL,13,Fsaid it had intercepted eight missiles
OL,14,Fearly on Monday morning.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
